      "title": "Measurement",
      "body": "zero_loading_heat_of_adsorption_CO2 (CO2) = 39.0 K at 1.013 bar"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "partial_dissociation_of_zn_oxalate_bonding_affects_co2_affinity → qst"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "dry_air_or_vacuum_regenerates_alpha_phase → stability"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] use mild activation conditions such as low-RH room-temperature storage to remove pore water from CALF-20 → sufficient pore-water removal is expected without loss of crystallinity, improving economic viability for CO2 sorbent use"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] tune MOF pore size and shape to target selective physisorption → enables selective physisorption while avoiding the high regeneration energy penalty associated with chemisorption"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
      "body": "β-CALF-20 vs α-CALF-20: winner=subject_a on CO2_heat_of_adsorption"
    }
  ],
