  "notable_quotes": [
    "The humidity-driven transformation is not a simple lattice expansion/contraction, as in situ data show two-phase behavior during conversion.",
    "The α-to-β phase change in CALF-20 is fully reversible; dry air or vacuum regenerates α-CALF-20 from β-CALF-20.",
    "Extended exposure to humidity above 23% RH converts α-CALF-20 into a new polymorph, β-CALF-20."
